. Volume that day was 4.5M shares, 0.61x the prior 10-day average of 7.3M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $24.31, and the chart ends at $23.47.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that worked on light volume. The volume rule is a guide, not a law. It tilts the odds, and here the stock beat them."}}